     "body": "<p>Tested export from current DEV instance on 4.5.x using command</p>\n\n<p>java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.0.jar -m export -d /usr/csg-nas/harshau/fcrepo-2454/data -u archonnex:xxxx -r <a href=\"https://fedora.dev.icpsr.umich.edu/fedora/rest/openicpsr\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.dev.icpsr.umich.edu/fedora/rest/openicpsr</a></p>\n\n<p>Seems to work OK with no binaries</p>\n\n<p>Importing to a new instance on 4.7.3-RC1 is not working, need some assistance to locate the log and verify the config</p>\n\n<p>java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.0.jar -m import -d /usr/csg-nas/harshau/fcrepo-2454/data -r <a href=\"http://cnsdev0.icpsr.umich.edu:8082/fcrepo2/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://cnsdev0.icpsr.umich.edu:8082/fcrepo2/rest</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>",
