  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>Create subset of production-like ICPSR data in development environment. Test various import-export scenarios; e.g., </p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>export entire repository; wipe repository; import entire repository</li>\n\t<li>export single object; delete from repository (including tombstone); import object</li>\n\t<li>export subset of objects based on membership predicate; delete from repository (including tombstones); import objects</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The following instructions may be helpful in running the import/export utility:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Download the utility:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/releases\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/releases</a> </li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>See Readme for running the import/export utility:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/README.md\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/blob/master/README.md</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Have a running Fedora<br/>\nIf you do not have a Fedora to test with, you may want to start up the \"one-click run\": <br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Quick+Start#QuickStart-One-ClickRun\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Quick+Start#QuickStart-One-ClickRun</a> </li>\n</ol>\n",
